## Vue 2 vs Vue 3

| Feature | Vue 2 | Vue 3 |
|---------|-------|-------|
| **API** | Options API | Options API + Composition API |
| **Size** | ~33KB | ~33KB (but tree-shakeable) |
| **Performance** | Reactive | Reactive + Proxy-based |
| **TypeScript** | Partial | Full Support |
| **Bundle** | Single file | Modular |
| **Virtual DOM** | Slower diffing | Faster diffing algorithm |
| **Fragments** | No | Yes |

### Vue 2 Setup
```bash
npm install vue@2
npm install -g @vue/cli
vue create my-project
```

### Vue 3 Setup
```bash
npm create vite@latest my-project -- --template vue
cd my-project
npm install
npm run dev
```

