<button @click="count++">{{ count }}</button>
<button @click="greet('Hi')">Greet</button>

<!-- Multiple events -->
<input @keyup.enter="submit" @blur="onBlur" />

<!-- Event modifiers -->
<form @submit.prevent="onSubmit"></form>
<a @click.stop="doSomething"></a>
<div @click.self="doSomething"></div>

<!-- Key modifiers -->
<input @keyup.enter="submit" />
<input @keydown.ctrl.a="selectAll" />
<input @keyup.space="onSpace" />

<!-- Mouse modifiers -->
<div @click.left="doThis"></div>
<div @click.right="doThat"></div>
```

#### v-bind / : - Theory: Attribute Data Binding

**Why v-bind Exists:**
```html
<!-- ❌ Without v-bind (static) -->
<img src="image.jpg">
<div class="active">Content</div>

<!-- Problem: Can't change based on component data -->
<!-- Must dynamically generate attribute value -->

<!-- ✅ With v-bind (dynamic) -->
