### Security Considerations

#### XSS (Cross-Site Scripting) Prevention

```html
<!-- Vue protects by default - escapes HTML -->

<!-- Data -->
<script setup>
const userInput = ref('<img src=x onerror="alert(\'hacked\')">')
</script>

<!-- ✅ SAFE: {{ }} auto-escapes -->
<div>{{ userInput }}</div>
<!-- Renders: &lt;img src=x onerror="alert('hacked')"&gt; -->
<!-- The HTML tags are displayed as text, not executed -->

<!-- ❌ DANGEROUS: v-html renders as HTML -->
